      "content": "that's a good start. it definitely captures that sense of urgency. \n\nto make him feel even more real, i want to push back against the critics in the monologue. could you add a section where he addresses the people who call his views \"cruel\" or \"inhumane\"? i want him to argue why those people are actually the ones being immoral or out of touch with reality. make it a strong rebuttal.",
