      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Elias's voice remained steadfast as he faced the gathering skeptics head-on.\n\n\"Why do some of you label our approach as 'cruel,' deeming it 'inhumane'? Let us question the moral high ground they claim. The current global migration trends are not only overwhelming our homeland, but also creating massive humanitarian crises. Harboring those who break our laws while disregarding the ensuing chaos, in my view, is the greater cruelty. Their heartlessness lies in allowing our resources to be exploited by those who have no regard for our hard-earned prosperity.\n\nYou speak of hardship, but you need to bear in mind that unchecked immigration floods our borders, leading to job losses for our citizens, overcrowded schools, and overwhelmed emergency services. While some advocate for open borders as a display of 'humanitarianism,' I ask: at what cost to our own citizens? It's we who must be compassionate, not towards those exploiting our goodwill but towards the future of our country, our children, and our grandchildren.\n\nBy implementing zero-tolerance policies, we are not abandoning our moral duty; we are fulfilling our commitment to protect our people and preserve our nation's integrity. True morality lies in safeguarding the lives of those who call our country home, ensuring they",
